# Store and check out every text file with LF endings, regardless of platform.
#
# Without this, files authored on Windows arrive as CRLF while the Linux GitHub
# runners write LF, so the same file churns back and forth between commits and
# `git add` warns on every text file it touches. Pinning the working tree to LF
# as well as the index means no conversion happens in either direction.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binaries -- rewriting bytes inside these corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pkl binary
*.h5 binary
*.keras binary
